serve concerning you any pact of kinship or covenant of protection? They satisfy you with their mouths, but their hearts refuse [compliance], and most of them are defiantly disobedient.","j":10,"h":19,"s":9,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"9:9","t":"They have exchanged the signs of Allāh for a small price and averted [people] from His way. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.","j":10,"h":19,"s":9,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"9:10","t":"They do not observe toward a believer any pact of kinship or covenant of protection. And it is they who are the transgressors.","j":10,"h":19,"s":9,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"9:11","t":"But if they repent, establish prayer, and give zakāh, then they are your brothers in religion; and We detail the verses for a people who know.","j":10,"h":19,"s":9,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"9:12","t":"And if they break their oaths after their treaty and defame your religion, then combat the leaders of disbelief, for indeed, there are no oaths [sacred] to them; [fight them that] they might cease.","j":10,"h":19,"s":9,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"9:13","t":"Would you not fight against a people who broke their oaths and determined to expel the Messenger, and they had begun [the attack upon] you the first time? Do you fear them? But Allāh has more right that you should fear Him, if you are [truly] believers.","j":10,"h":19,"s":9,"a":13,"sd":null}],"juz":10,"hizb":19,"surahs":[9],"sajdah":false}